<Pagina titulo="Terms of use" descricao={`Terms of use for ${SITE.nome}.`} alternativa={{ pt: u('/termos/') }}>
  <p>Last updated: November 19, 2026.</p>

  <h2>What the site offers</h2>
  <p>Information about GTA 6: cheats, easter eggs, secrets and tips. The content is free and meant for story mode.</p>

  <h2>Use at your own discretion</h2>
  <p>
    We check every tip before publishing and show the source, but the game gets updates and a tip may stop working. In GTA 6, using a cheat turns
    off trophies, achievements and saving until you quit. Save your game before trying anything.
  </p>
  <p>We do not publish or support cheating online. It can get your account banned by Rockstar.</p>

  <h2>Rights</h2>
  <p>
    The text on this site is ours. You may quote an excerpt with a link back to the page. Embedded videos belong to their creators and play
    straight from YouTube. Images taken from gameplay videos are credited to the creator and removed on request. Grand Theft Auto, GTA and
    related names are trademarks of Take-Two Interactive and Rockstar Games, with which we have no affiliation.
  </p>

  <h2>Ads and links</h2>
  <p>The site shows ads and may contain affiliate links, always labeled. We are not responsible for the content of third-party sites.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>These terms may be updated. The date at the top shows the current version.</p>
</Pagina>
